CommitDate: Tue Oct 6 10:45:49 2026 -0500

    chore(deps): update outdated Node packages (DEPS-DUCKBRAIN-2026-10-04)
    
    Direct-range `pnpm outdated` before: @aws-sdk/client-s3 3.1145.0->3.1146.0,
    @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.31.0->1.32.1, simple-git 3.36.0->4.0.2. The row's
    "9" is the supervisor's transitive-inclusive count; after this change both
    `pnpm outdated` and `npm outdated` report none.
    
    Group A (patch/minor, no breaking notes):
    - @aws-sdk/client-s3 3.1146.0 — upstream changelog: "Version bump only for
      package @aws-sdk/client-s3".
    - @modelcontextprotocol/sdk ^1.32.1 — 1.32.1 is docs + version only; 1.32.0
      added an OPTIONAL `expectedResource` to requireBearerAuth (off by default).
      Dependency set is identical to 1.31.0.
    
    Group B (major, GO): simple-git ^4.0.2. v4 removed the default export, so
    src/git/worker.ts now uses `import { simpleGit } from "simple-git"`. The tree
    has no gitP / simple-git/promise / raw() abbreviated-option / unsafe-env usage,
    and worker.ts is the only simple-git call site. v4 still ships a CJS build
    (dist/index.cjs), so the commonjs project can require it. Verified at runtime:
    a scratch-repo probe (init/add/commit/log) passes on 4.0.2, and a negative
    control confirms the removed default-import shape is not callable.
    
    Verification:
    - npx tsc --noEmit: rc=0 (both groups).
    - Targeted git/ s3/ mcp/ http/: 89 files / 641 tests passed.
    - Full suite `npx vitest run`: 201 files / 1621 tests passed.
    - scripts/sync-agents-md-counts.sh --check: counts unchanged (201/1621).
    - npm ci --dry-run: rc=0 (the Dockerfile job's `npm ci` stays in sync).
    - Both lockfiles refreshed: pnpm-lock.yaml (CI `--frozen-lockfile`) and
      package-lock.json (root Dockerfile `npm ci`); diffs limited to the three
      packages plus simple-git's transitive deps.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
